{"seq":3,"slug":"network-roi-review","title":"仓网 ROI 定期复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-plan-ops/network-roi-review","wordCount":2854,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"仓网-roi-定期复盘\">仓网 ROI 定期复盘</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-复盘是为了校准而非打分\">核心概念：复盘是为了校准而非打分</h2><p>仓网规划是一组基于当时假设做出的决策，而假设会过期。ROI 复盘的价值不在于给过去的决策打分，而在于回答一个面向未来的问题：<strong>这个网络的结构还成立吗，还是我们已经在用一个过期的网络服务今天的生意</strong>。这个问法把复盘从「述职」变成了「校准」，也决定了复盘的组织方式——它需要的是可比较的口径与明确的触发条件，而不是一次性的漂亮报告。</p>\n<p>复盘失败有两种典型形态，方向相反。<strong>形态一：复盘变成算术检查</strong>。只核算「这个仓今年赚没赚回它的投入」，逐仓看盈亏，于是每个仓都在自己的口径下看起来还行，而网络整体的结构性问题（例如三个仓的覆盖域严重重叠、跨区发货占比逐年上升）完全没有进入视野。<strong>形态二：复盘变成重做规划</strong>。每次复盘都重新跑一遍完整仿真、重新选址、重新分配，成本极高且结论频繁变动，业务无法承受。</p>\n<p>正确的复盘介于两者之间：<strong>用一组固定的网络级指标持续监测，用明确的触发条件决定何时升级为完整重规划</strong>。监测是常规动作，重规划是例外动作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[网络级指标月度采集] --&gt; B[偏差计算&lt;br/&gt;实际 vs 规划假设]&#10;  B --&gt; C{偏差类型}&#10;  C --&gt;|假设偏差| D[更新假设,不改结构]&#10;  C --&gt;|结构偏差| E{触发条件命中?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[继续监测&lt;br/&gt;记录趋势]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[升级:启动完整重规划&lt;br/&gt;见仿真与情景]&#10;  D --&gt; H[进入下一期]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; I[决策:开/关/迁移&lt;br/&gt;或调整承诺与分配]&#10;  I --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[网络级指标月度采集] --&gt; B[偏差计算&lt;br/&gt;实际 vs 规划假设]\n  B --&gt; C{偏差类型}\n  C --&gt;|假设偏差| D[更新假设,不改结构]\n  C --&gt;|结构偏差| E{触发条件命中?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[继续监测&lt;br/&gt;记录趋势]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[升级:启动完整重规划&lt;br/&gt;见仿真与情景]\n  D --&gt; H[进入下一期]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; I[决策:开/关/迁移&lt;br/&gt;或调整承诺与分配]\n  I --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"指标口径-网络级而不是仓级\">指标口径：网络级而不是仓级</h2><h3 id=\"五个网络级指标\">五个网络级指标</h3><p>逐仓盈亏是必要的但不是充分的。网络级复盘需要五个指标，它们的共同特点是<strong>只有把节点放在一起看才有意义</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>它揭示的结构问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨区发货占比</td>\n<td>本地节点有货却走远端的订单比例</td>\n<td>覆盖域设计不合理或分配规则失灵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点覆盖重叠度</td>\n<td>同一邮编区被多个节点在同档时效内覆盖的比例</td>\n<td>冗余过多，可合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺达成率偏差</td>\n<td>分档实际达成率与承诺目标之差</td>\n<td>承诺与能力脱节（或网络退化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络总持有成本/件</td>\n<td>全部节点库存持有成本 ÷ 出库件数</td>\n<td>分仓过度导致库存分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点集中度</td>\n<td>最大节点承担的出库量占比</td>\n<td>冗余不足的风险敞口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这五个指标必须<strong>同源同口径</strong>地按月产出，且与规划期的预测值并列显示。并列才有信息量——「跨区发货占比 11%」本身没有含义，「跨区发货占比 11%，而规划假设是 5%」才有含义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与规划假设的对齐\">与规划假设的对齐</h3><p>规划的每个结论都建立在假设上，这些假设必须在规划文档里被显式记录，否则复盘时无从比对。最小假设清单包括：各市场的量增长、每仓的达产曲线、末端费率指数、以及关务/税制情景。复盘的第一步就是把实际值与这份清单逐项对照。</p>\n<p>对照的方式不是「差值多少」，而是「这个差值是否落到模型当初声明的敏感性范围内」。若当初的情景分析（见 <a href=\"../network-simulation-scenario/scenario-sensitivity-analysis\">情景与敏感性分析</a>）已经覆盖了当期实际值，说明模型有效、假设在预期内，无需触发；若实际值落在当初声明的范围之外，那本身就是一条独立的触发信号——它意味着<strong>模型的输入空间不足</strong>，无论网络指标是否正常，都应当先扩充情景再判断。</p>\n<p>一个常用的长期对照工具是把网络成本的实际值与规划值按年画在同一条时间轴上，用绝对百分比误差度量偏离：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MAPE}=\\frac{100}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}|A_t-F_t|/|A_t|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAPE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为实测、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为规划值（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_absolute_percentage_error\">Mean absolute percentage error</a>）。它有两个已知缺陷必须注意：实测值接近零时不稳定，以及低估与高估的惩罚不对称。对「单点集中度」「跨区发货占比」这类可能接近零的指标，应改用绝对误差或分位数损失，否则 MAPE 会给出误导性的「模型很准」的结论。误差度量的系统性讨论见 Hyndman 与 Koehler（2006, <em>International Journal of Forecasting</em> 22(4), 679–688）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;network_review&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;period&quot;: &quot;2026-Q3&quot;,&#10;    &quot;plan_version&quot;: &quot;2025-Q4-netplan&quot;,&#10;    &quot;assumption_deltas&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;volume_growth_us&quot;, &quot;planned&quot;: 0.28, &quot;actual&quot;: 0.41, &quot;impact&quot;: &quot;capacity_pressure&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;lastmile_rate_index&quot;, &quot;planned&quot;: 1.0, &quot;actual&quot;: 1.14, &quot;impact&quot;: &quot;cost_overrun&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;dc_lax_ramp_months&quot;, &quot;planned&quot;: 6, &quot;actual&quot;: 11, &quot;impact&quot;: &quot;unit_cost_high&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;customs_duty_regime&quot;, &quot;planned&quot;: &quot;status_quo&quot;, &quot;actual&quot;: &quot;status_quo&quot;, &quot;impact&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;network_metrics&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;xregion_shipment_share&quot;: { &quot;planned&quot;: 0.05, &quot;actual&quot;: 0.11 },&#10;      &quot;coverage_overlap_ratio&quot;: { &quot;planned&quot;: 0.18, &quot;actual&quot;: 0.34 },&#10;      &quot;otd_gap_max_band&quot;: { &quot;planned&quot;: 0.0, &quot;actual&quot;: -0.06 },&#10;      &quot;holding_cost_per_pkg&quot;: { &quot;planned&quot;: 1.42, &quot;actual&quot;: 1.71 },&#10;      &quot;top_node_concentration&quot;: { &quot;planned&quot;: 0.31, &quot;actual&quot;: 0.44 }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;triggers_hit&quot;: [&quot;xregion_share_gt_2x_plan&quot;, &quot;overlap_gt_0.30&quot;, &quot;otd_gap_lt_minus_0.05&quot;],&#10;    &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;structural_replan_required&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"network_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"plan_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-Q4-netplan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assumption_deltas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"volume_growth_us\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"planned\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.41</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"impact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"capacity_pressure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lastmile_rate_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"planned\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"impact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_overrun\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color